OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fwarm evening sunshine to come, then
OL,7,Fremaining dry and fine overnight with
OL,8,Flong clear spells. A few mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches may form, with rural
OL,10,Ftemperatures dipping into single
OL,11,Ffigures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day,
OL,14,Falthough rather breezy around coasts,
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells and some cloud. A
OL,16,Frisk of some light rain arriving into
OL,17,Fthe far west later. Feeling slightly
OL,18,Fwarmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
